Cora DIY Agent

This is an independent adaptation of the Microsoft Ignite 2025 LAB512 sample:
https://github.com/microsoft/ignite25-LAB512-prototyping-multimodal-agents-with-microsoft-foundry-and-the-ai-toolkit

The Zava assistant instructions, customer-sales MCP server, PostgreSQL helper,
database initialization script, sample database backup, and example room image
originate from that repository. Their original Microsoft copyright notice is
preserved in LICENSE. LICENSE-DOCS preserves the upstream CC BY-SA 4.0 text for
inherited documentation and instructional content.

This adaptation adds the browser UI, streaming HTTP server, conversation-session
handling, tests, environment configuration, and public setup documentation.

